{
  "_about": "What the weekly refresh (scripts/psyc-feed.mjs) reads for the psyc paper. Deliberately broad: it is meant to surface things you would not search for, so it follows journals and fields rather than topics or a syllabus. Field journals set a paper's category directly. General journals only contribute papers whose title and abstract clearly match a category below. Edit this file on GitHub to change where new papers come from; no code changes needed.",
  "settings": {
    "window_days": 365,
    "max_per_category": 40,
    "max_per_topic": 3,
    "preprint_share": 0.1,
    "citing_share": 0.25
  },
